    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where $ \\operatorname{Var}(e) $ is an estimate of $ \\sigma_{e}^{2} $ (the within-marker class variance). Aspects of this approach are further examined by Geldermann (1975), Weller et al. (1990), and van der Beck et al. (1995).",
