      "content": "where the mean squares are given in Table 18.3. Assuming normality, Equation 16.14 follows an $F$ distribution under the null hypothesis that $\\sigma_{m}^{2}=0$. Assuming a balanced design with $N$ sires, each with $n/2$ half-sibs in each marker class, Equation 16.14 has $N$ and $N(n-2)$ degrees of freedom. Chapter 18 discusses the appropriate degrees of freedom under an unbalanced design.",
