      "content": "The first equality follows from Table 18.3, while the second follows by noting that the mean phenotype of progeny of the ith sire is $ \\overline{z}_{i} = (\\overline{z}_{i1} + \\overline{z}_{i2})/2 $, where $ \\overline{z}_{ij} $ is the mean trait value for marker j in family i.",
